    "errors": {
      "why": "How a non-2xx from ANY OAuth operation is reported. type: oauth is the OAuth error, accessDenied and expiredToken its two distinct subtypes, client the SDK's ordinary error. Only a 4xx whose body is a JSON object with a string error member is an OAuth error; message is asserted only for OAuth errors. rawBody is sent verbatim, body as JSON.",
