          "why": "A sleep that would end past the local deadline ends at it, and the local expiry follows with no request sent: the outcome the full sleep reaches anyway, without asking the runtime for a sleep it may not hold (.NET's Task.Delay throws past ~49.7 days). 2147483647 is the largest interval every SDK's type holds.",
